{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013eERhrKoeWDd3DqZLbt4hA","type":"tool_result","content":"# Kubernetes Pod Assignment Commands and Instructions\n\n1. **List nodes in cluster:**\n   ```shell\n   kubectl get nodes\n   ```\n\n2. **List nodes WITH labels:**\n   ```shell\n   kubectl get nodes --show-labels\n   ```\n\n3. **Add label to a node:**\n   ```shell\n   kubectl label nodes <your-node-name> disktype=ssd\n   ```\n\n4. **Verify label was added:**\n   ```shell\n   kubectl get nodes --show-labels\n   ```\n\n5. **Verify pod scheduled to chosen node:**\n   ```shell\n   kubectl get pods --output=wide\n   ```\n\n6. **Node selector explanation:**\n   \"This pod configuration file describes a pod that has a node selector,\n   `disktype: ssd`. This means that the pod will get scheduled on a node that\n   has a `disktype=ssd` label.\""}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c5de4450-c1f8-40eb-9c44-c8ddc092eae4","uuid":"a6111523-b137-453c-8eff-7fdfc12027f6","timestamp":"2026-08-24T13:41:01.553Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":2958,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Kubernetes Pod Assignment Commands and Instructions\n\n1. **List nodes in cluster:**\n   ```shell\n   kubectl get nodes\n   ```\n\n2. **List nodes WITH labels:**\n   ```shell\n   kubectl get nodes --show-labels\n   ```\n\n3. **Add label to a node:**\n   ```shell\n   kubectl label nodes <your-node-name> disktype=ssd\n   ```\n\n4. **Verify label was added:**\n   ```shell\n   kubectl get nodes --show-labels\n   ```\n\n5. **Verify pod scheduled to chosen node:**\n   ```shell\n   kubectl get pods --output=wide\n   ```\n\n6. **Node selector explanation:**\n   \"This pod configuration file describes a pod that has a node selector,\n   `disktype: ssd`. This means that the pod will get scheduled on a node that\n   has a `disktype=ssd` label.\"","durationMs":2378,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/main/content/en/docs/tasks/configure-pod-container/assign-pods-nodes.md"}}
