{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YY6FZXkqyi2j7DNTuGUJiL","type":"tool_result","content":"# Node Allocatable Definitions\n\n**1. Definition of Node Allocatable:**\n\"'Allocatable' on a Kubernetes node is defined as the amount of compute resources that are available for pods.\"\n\n**2. Relationship/Equation between Capacity, Reserves, and Allocatable:**\nNOT PRESENT. The document includes a diagram reference (`![node capacity](/images/docs/node-capacity.svg)`) but the actual formula or ASCII diagram is not provided in the text content.\n\n**3. Scheduler Treatment of Allocatable:**\n\"The scheduler does not over-subscribe 'Allocatable'.\"\n\nAdditionally: \"The scheduler treats 'Allocatable' as the available `capacity` for pods.\""}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c5de4450-c1f8-40eb-9c44-c8ddc092eae4","uuid":"1033e33f-9b0b-4d17-9c82-48dd0d4000c9","timestamp":"2026-08-24T13:41:35.403Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":12198,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Node Allocatable Definitions\n\n**1. Definition of Node Allocatable:**\n\"'Allocatable' on a Kubernetes node is defined as the amount of compute resources that are available for pods.\"\n\n**2. Relationship/Equation between Capacity, Reserves, and Allocatable:**\nNOT PRESENT. The document includes a diagram reference (`![node capacity](/images/docs/node-capacity.svg)`) but the actual formula or ASCII diagram is not provided in the text content.\n\n**3. Scheduler Treatment of Allocatable:**\n\"The scheduler does not over-subscribe 'Allocatable'.\"\n\nAdditionally: \"The scheduler treats 'Allocatable' as the available `capacity` for pods.\"","durationMs":2711,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/main/content/en/docs/tasks/administer-cluster/reserve-compute-resources.md"}}
